-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT THIS COVERS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Deliberately the most permissive licence there is: no attribution required, no
notice to retain, no restriction on commercial use. Take it, ship it, sell it,
relicense it — no strings.

It covers everything in this repository: every implementation (C, NEON, CUDA,
OpenCL, HVX), the harness, the scripts, the synthetic scenes and their goldens,
the reports, and the generated figures and decks — with the single exception
named below.

EXCEPTION — one figure. `docs/panels/motorcycle_real.png` is a rendered panel
whose leftmost image is a frame from the Middlebury 2014 Stereo Dataset
("Motorcycle"), reproduced to illustrate the accuracy measurement. That frame
belongs to its authors and is not the author's to relicense; see THIRD-PARTY.md.

The dataset itself is NOT redistributed here. `data/real/` is deliberately
untracked; `scripts/fetch_middlebury.sh` retrieves the scene from the source so
that every user accepts its terms directly from the people who set them.
